SharpHand.ng – Technical Documentation

1. Overview
SharpHand.ng is a mobile-first, web-based platform connecting people to nearby skilled workers. The MVP is built for speed:
    • Get Started opens a map → the user picks a service → nearby workers appear on the map → they connect with name and phone
    • Customers do not create an account before finding or connecting to a worker
    • No in-app payments in the MVP (later added)
    • Workers may be monetized via subscriptions or featured listings in future phases
Target Devices:
    • Mobile (primary)
    • Desktop (secondary, responsive design)
Core Goal:
    • Fast, reliable connections between people and local service providers, without a signup wall

Customer flow (MVP):
    1. Tap Get Started
    2. See a map of their area and “What service do you need?”
    3. Choose a service (Plumbing, Electrical, Cleaning, Carpentry)
    4. See verified available workers close to them on the map
    5. Connect with name + phone only — the worker’s number is shown after the connection is created

