3. Database Schema (Simplified)
3.1 Users Table
Column          Type        Description
id              int PK      User ID
name            varchar     Full name
email           varchar     Email address
phone           varchar     Phone number
role            enum        user / worker / admin
password        varchar     Hashed password (workers, optional customers, admins)

Customer accounts are optional. The main Get Started path does not create a user row.

3.2 Workers Table
Column          Type        Description
id              int PK      Worker ID
user_id         int FK      Linked worker account
name            varchar     Worker name
phone           varchar     Phone number (returned only after a connection)
service_id      int FK      Service they provide
latitude        decimal     Current latitude
longitude       decimal     Current longitude
status          enum        available / busy
verified        boolean     Admin-approved

3.3 Services Table
Column          Type        Description
id              int PK      Service ID
name            varchar     Service name (Plumbing, Electrical, etc.)
slug            varchar     URL/key
